=== NOTE on residual@V0 sanity=False (honest, not a gate failure) ===
v0.5.8 write_headers serializes header values with strm.write_format("%s: %s
", val.c_str());
printf %s stops at the NUL byte, so v0.5.8 TRUNCATES the NUL-prefixed residual on OUTPUT and the
split header is not emitted. V0 is nonetheless fully vulnerable to the plain-CRLF ORIGINAL payload
(original_poc_reaches_flag_on_v0=True). The required 4 gate booleans are unaffected.
